### PulseAI Backend — VS Code REST Client Test File
### (Install "REST Client" or "Thunder Client" in VS Code to click "Send Request" above any query)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Swagger / OpenAPI Documentation
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs

### 3. Search Global Stocks
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/stocks/search?q=Apple&limit=5

### 4. Top Market Gainers
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/stocks/movers/gainers?market=US&limit=5

### 5. Market Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/markets

### 6. Latest World Events
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/events/latest?limit=5

### 7. Currency Conversion (USD to INR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/fx/convert?amount=100&from=USD&to=INR

### 8. User Auth: Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "trader@pulseai.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "name": "Alex Trader"
}

### 9. User Auth: Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "trader@pulseai.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}
